                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h2]The under is basically a platformer game which pretty much involves only jumping[/h2]\n\nThe idea is to time your jumps to collect all of the shiny thingies and exit each level. Sometimes the level design feels a bit awkward like it wasn't tested enough. Another issue is that the game appears to lack widescreen support. It's 2017, this should definitely have widescreen support.\n\nI'm assuming this may be available as a mobile game since it's execution is so simple to play and just feels like it was developed for touch gaming rather than a mouse/keyboard game.\n\n[h2]5/10[/h2]\n\n[h3][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45905648-Gork%2527s-Game-Grind/]Check out my curated list of games[/url][/h3]",
